      <xs:enumeration value="NEW">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation>Control of Network Enabled Weapons (NEW) Only. The tasked control agency has responsibility for controlling only the Network Enabled Weapons (NEW) onboard the aircraft or vessel for the assigned mission being controlled.</xs:documentation>
