        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:enumeration>
      <xs:enumeration value="CURRENT">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation>Current Controller. The network participant with control authority to issue directives to the assigned weapon including retargeting the weapon, aborting the weapon, and handing the weapon off to a new controlling unit.</xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:enumeration>
      <xs:enumeration value="IFTU3PS">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation>In-Flight Target Update-Third Party Source. The IFTU3PS is the unit who has been delegated target update authority by the weapon’s current controller. This authority permits the unit to establish communications with the weapon and to provide target updates for the weapon’s assigned target. The unit has no other control authority.</xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:enumeration>
