        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:enumeration>
      <xs:enumeration value="2A">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation>Grade Two Alpha. Fixed wing mission Grade Two controllers can lead up to 4 aircraft under close control, up to 4 under loose control and 5 and over under broadcast control. Safety Grade Alpha denotes that controllers can provide positive control services. STANAG 1183.</xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:enumeration>
